    "Your measurements and profiles stay on your device. Optional feedback is submitted through Monoware Support and does not include health data or a device identifier.": "您的测量结果和个人资料保留在您的设备上。可选反馈通过 Monoware 支持提交，不包括健康数据或设备标识符。",
